<!-- 2. Sound familiar -->
<section class="section bg-white" aria-labelledby="problems-heading">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 id="problems-heading" class="h-section mb-3 text-center">Sound familiar?</h2>
    <p class="lede mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center">These are the problems we look for on local business websites, and what each one can cost you.</p>
    <ul class="space-y-4">
      <li class="card flex gap-4 p-5 md:p-6">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong class="block text-lg text-gray-900">Your site is tiny on phones.</strong> Customers have to pinch and zoom to read it, so they back out and call someone else.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card flex gap-4 p-5 md:p-6">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong class="block text-lg text-gray-900">Chrome says &ldquo;Not secure.&rdquo;</strong> Visitors see a warning next to your name, and some leave before they read a word.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card flex gap-4 p-5 md:p-6">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong class="block text-lg text-gray-900">There is no way to book online.</strong> A customer who wants an appointment at 9 p.m. has to wait until morning, and some will book with someone else.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card flex gap-4 p-5 md:p-6">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong class="block text-lg text-gray-900">It is slow to load.</strong> On a phone, people don't wait. A slow page loses some of them.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card flex gap-4 p-5 md:p-6">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong class="block text-lg text-gray-900">It is hard for people using screen readers.</strong> That can keep blind and low-vision customers from reading your site or booking.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <div class="mt-10 text-center">
      <p class="mb-4 text-lg text-gray-800">See one of these on your own site? We will show you.</p>
      <a href="{{ site.writeupCta.href }}" class="btn-primary">Get my free website write-up</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

